# The vendored artefact is verified by its sha256, so git must not touch a byte
# of it. Without this, line-ending translation rewrites the file on checkout and
# the reproduction check in README.md fails for ever on a Windows clone -- which
# is exactly how the unminified bundle came out 806 bytes adrift while being
# identical in content.
hls.min.js -text -diff
LICENSE -text
hls.d.ts -text
